Source files, from https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/:

    cities15000.zip, admin1CodesASCII.txt, countryInfo.txt,
    timeZones.txt, alternateNamesV2.zip

Changes made by Scripts/build-cities.py: historical, abandoned and destroyed
places dropped; columns reduced to name, ASCII name, up to five alternate
names, country, first-level region, population, time zone and a coordinate
rounded to four decimal places; region and country names joined in from the
admin1 and country tables; a small set of country aliases and Canadian and
Australian region abbreviations added.

